comments.body:
@nshtg - Yes, you are correct that Dexcom Follow would be a way to go to see multiple reading at once, but the options for multiple alerts, widgets, and notifications that are available in XDrip are far superior and now that I've been using them, I find them irreplaceable.  But thank you for the backup plan!

@whoiswes - Thank you for responding.  I'll give a look at AppCloner.  I was under the impression that XDrip was just pulling the data directly from the Nightscout API - ie. no Google involvement.  Regardless, this might work well.  I'll give this method a try.

Thanks!!
